# Modules: per-action `out/` residue dropped by reasoning-action runs.
# Audit-modules.md (DEAD residue): dogfood runs copy templates into
# modules/<module>/<action>/out/. Explicit, scoped suppression — do NOT rely
# on the catch-all `out/` rule above (it is too broad and historically
# incidental).
modules/**/out/
